📘 6. WHY THIS IS NOT YET A COMPLETE PRODUCTION DESIGN

🎯 Key Principle:
          A senior engineer should identify not only what a design
          solves, but also what it does NOT solve.

+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| 🔍 Concern         | ⚙️ Current Solution      | 🚀 Production Consideration      |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| ➕ Adding           | Straightforward          | A registry or factory may be     |
| implementations    |                          | needed to select implementations |
|                    |                          | dynamically.                     |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| ✅ Validation       | Not included             | Validate the amount and request  |
|                    |                          | data before processing payment.  |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| 🔒 Thread safety   | Service holds a          | The payment implementation must  |
|                    | reference in a final     | also be safe for concurrent use  |
|                    | field.                   | if it is shared between threads. |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| ⚠️ Failures        | Not handled              | Model payment failures, timeouts,|
|                    |                          | retries and idempotency.         |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| 🌐 External        | Simulated with           | Isolate provider APIs and        |
| providers          | console output.          | credentials.                     |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+
| 🧪 Testing         | Easy to inject a         | Test success, failure and        |
|                    | test implementation.     | concurrency behavior where      |
|                    |                          | relevant.                        |
+--------------------+--------------------------+----------------------------------+

Notice that we should not introduce a factory, registry, 
retry mechanism, or distributed architecture automatically. 
Each addition should solve a demonstrated requirement.

